CubeCrash Privacy Policy

Last Updated: August 3, 2026

Welcome

CubeCrash, published by Weezard Games, is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains how the game handles information and your choices when using the app.

Game Data

CubeCrash saves gameplay information such as progress, scores, unlocked milestones, settings, and preferences. This information is primarily stored on your device to support your experience.

Advertising Services

The game may use advertising platforms, including Google AdMob, to display ads. These providers may process limited technical information and advertising identifiers under their own privacy policies.

Diagnostics

Anonymous crash reports and performance metrics may be used to improve stability, fix bugs, balance gameplay, and enhance future releases. We do not intentionally use this information to identify individual players.

Data Protection

Reasonable security measures are applied to protect information processed by CubeCrash. Although no technology is completely secure, we continuously improve our practices.

Children

CubeCrash is suitable for a general audience. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If such information is believed to have been collected, please contact us for review and removal where appropriate.

Future Features

Future versions may introduce optional cloud saves, online rankings, events, or social features. If additional information is required for these services, this policy will be updated before launch.

Your Control

You may stop data processing related to the app by uninstalling CubeCrash. Device settings may also allow you to manage advertising preferences.

Policy Changes

This Privacy Policy may be revised periodically. Updates will be reflected by changing the 'Last Updated' date.

Contact

For privacy questions regarding CubeCrash, please contact Weezard Games through the official support details available on the application's store listing.

Closing

Thank you for playing CubeCrash. We value your trust and aim to provide a secure, transparent, and enjoyable gaming experience.
